sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(KServe Route)
    participant Auth as AuthenticationMiddleware<br/>(ASGI)
    participant API as FastAPI API Server<br/>8000/TCP
    participant Engine as AsyncLLM Engine<br/>(PagedAttention)
    participant Model as Model Weights<br/>(CPU Memory)
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Model Loading (Startup)
    API->>+HF: GET model config/weights<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>-API: Model artifacts
    API->>S3: GET model artifacts (optional)<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: AWS IAM (S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID)
    S3-->>API: Tensorizer serialized model
    API->>Model: Load weights into CPU memory

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: Inference Request
    Client->>+Auth: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS :8000<br/>Encryption: Configurable TLS
    Auth->>Auth: Validate Bearer Token<br/>(if VLLM_API_KEY set)
    Auth->>+API: Forward authenticated request
    API->>+Engine: Submit inference request<br/>(in-process IPC)
    Engine->>Model: Forward pass<br/>(in-memory)
    Model-->>Engine: Token logits
    Engine-->>-API: Generated tokens<br/>(streaming or batch)
    API-->>-Auth: JSON response
    Auth-->>-Client: HTTP 200<br/>application/json

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 3: Streaming Response (SSE)
    Client->>Auth: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>stream: true
    Auth->>API: Forward request
    API->>Engine: Submit streaming request
    loop Token Generation
        Engine->>Model: Forward pass
        Model-->>Engine: Next token
        Engine-->>API: Token chunk
        API-->>Client: SSE: data: {"choices":[...]}
    end
    API-->>Client: SSE: data: [DONE]
